"sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 184.18751220703126, 146.36192626953124, 195.64617919921875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986509010195732}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 210.9244140625, 541.454541015625, 256.75908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9981319904327393}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 272.0373046875, 536.801416015625, 302.1693603515625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984620551805239}], "snippet": "第十三条期限问答\n\n问：十五天是工作日吗？答：本文写的是15个自然日，包含周末与节假日。问：财务需要在15天内付款吗？答：15天是申请提交期限，本文没有规定付款时限。问：补开发票后期限重新开始吗？答：本文没有这一规定，不能自动重新起算。\n\n问：超过15天是否绝对不能报？答：本文没有规定超期处置、豁免条件和批准权限，不能推导出绝对结论。问：本制度是否只适用于某", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 0.0, "vector_score": 0.458327}]}}
